   408	    /// -- falls back to scanning all ecosystems for `name`.
   409	    ///
   410	    /// Fallback finds exactly one match: returns it. Finds more than one
   411	    /// (two ecosystems both have `name`): returns `None` to prevent
   412	    /// silent misresolution -- callers holding a `&mut Vec<Diagnostic>`
